    rdfs:label "obsolete campanulate"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "OBSOLETE. A shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of having an inflated tubular basal portion that widens gradually toward a distal limb or lobes."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Provisional FLOPO bridge for the PATO request PATO-CAND:campanulate; PATO released PATO:0104350 on 2026-10-01 (https://github.com/pato-ontology/pato/pull/618). Obsoleted on 2026-11-08; every FLOPO axiom now uses the PATO identifier (tools/migrate_pato_bridges.py)."@en ;
