obo:FLOPO_0985020 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "floral corona"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A collective organ part structure that is a ring or series of floral appendages situated between the corolla and the androecium and derived from the corolla, the androecium, or both."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Approved FLOPO botanical concept proposal SURFACE-CAND:corona (curation/botanical_concept_proposals.tsv, curator decision accept_with_revision on 2026-09-18). Provisional FLOPO-local representation of a class proposed to PO (curation/upstream_drafts/po-pr-5-anatomy-classes.md); replace it with the PO identifier via IAO:0100001 once assigned. No PO or PATO identifier is minted locally."@en ;
